# Firmware images and device dumps — NEVER commit these.
# The NV/ENV partitions (senv/cenv/fenv) and localstorage contain live device
# secrets: Wi-Fi PSK, service API credentials, tokens, UUIDs, GPS coordinates
# and private URLs. The factory partitions carry per-device certs/keys, and the
# firmware ships an SSH host key that is identical on every unit.
fw/
*.img
*.bin
83_IMAGE_NETWORK*
.omx/
